  "description": "OKLO is up 44% since we reviewed it...and this chart structure is identical 🪞",
  "body_html": "<p>This company has been on my radar for a long time. Traded it 3 times; 1 successful, 1 break even, 1 unsuccessful. Each of those times, I was seeking a larger breakout and higher profit targets, but market conditions kept holding it back. Today, it broke out…finally 😮‍💨… and hit a new 52 week high. Considering the momentum on the macro charts, I think the trend will be our friend, and the patience will have paid off. Buy high, sell higher… You may also recall, the OKLO review we did recently, where we targeted the breakout… it is up 44% since then…the chart structures are very similar.  </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
